{"id":"lesson-1533","topicId":1533,"title":"第三单元","sourceTitle":"高中語文 - 第三单元","blockId":"xuanbi-zhong","blockTitle":"選必中","forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1533","createdAt":"2024-08-09T08:05:42Z","updatedAt":"2025-02-15T04:17:25Z","postCount":3,"excerpt":"历史是一面镜子,它映照着现实,也预示着未来。了解历史,不忘过去,才能看清前进的方向;尊重历史,以史为鉴,才能更好地走向未来。 历史著作在中国古代文化典籍中占有重要的位置。本单元选入了《史记》《汉书》中的两篇经典作品,我们可以从中窥见古代史家的历史观念、开创精神;选入的两篇史论,均意在劝诫,总结历史经验教训,为当时的社会政治服务,其观点至今仍然具有借鉴价值。 学习本单元,要“回到历史现场”,鉴赏作品的叙事艺术和说理艺术,领会其中体现的历史观念、家国情怀和担当精神;理解史家对笔下人物的认识和评价,把握论者的观点和论述方式,学习和借鉴他们思考社会现实问题的态度和方法;丰富文言文的语言积累,学会在具体语境中分辨词语的意义和用法,把握古今汉语的差异与联系。 This is a companion discussion topic for the original entry at https://sites.google.com/view","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文选择性必修_中册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文选择性必修 中册（人教版）","imageBase":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156","tocLabel":"第三单元","tocScore":1.11,"startPage":85,"pages":[85],"pageImages":[{"page":85,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156/p85.webp","label":"p85","matched":true}],"contextPages":[65,66,67,68,69,70,71,72,73,74,75,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,83,84,85,86,87,88,89,90,91,92,93,94,95,96,97,98,99,100,101,102,103,104,105],"contextPageImages":[{"page":65,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156/p65.webp","label":"p65","matched":false},{"page":66,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156/p66.webp","label":"p66","matched":false},{"page":67,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156/p67.webp","label":"p67","matched":false},{"page":68,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156/p68.webp","label":"p68","matched":false},{"page":69,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156/p69.webp","label":"p69","matched":false},{"page":70,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156/p70.webp","label":"p70","matched":false},{"page":71,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156/p71.webp","label":"p71","matched":false},{"page":72,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/0433798ca156/p72.webp","label":"p72","matched":false},{"page":73,"src"